(74, 'MOHAMMAD ALSALTI', NULL, 2, 'Civil Engineering, Construction Engineering and Management', 'Mohammad holds a B.Sc. degree in Civil Engineering from Prince Sultan University and a M.Sc. degree in Construction Engineering and Management from King Fahd University of Petroleum and Minerals. Mohammad has a total of 8 years of professional industry and academic experience. Mohammad is currently the Operations Manager at Mada Group and a Board Member at TeleBuild.', 'Sustainable Construction\r\nConstruction Economics\r\nRisk Management\r\nConstruction Engineering\r\nGreen Building \r\nLeadership in Energy and Environmental Design (LEED)\r\nConstruction Planning and Scheduling \r\nStatistics\r\nQuality Management \r\nProject Delivery Systems \r\nAcademic and Scientific Research\r\nConstruction Estimating and Cost Management\r\nConstruction Equipment and Methods \r\nSoil Mechanics and Foundation\r\nReinforced Concrete\r\nBuilding Information Modelling (BIM)\r\nENGINEERING, AUTOCAD, REVIT\r\nAdministrative Planning & Monitoring\r\nLeadership, Team Management & Supervision\r\nConcrete Technology & Construction Risk Management\r\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT & QUALITY:\r\nPMP & Project Management with AI\r\nEconomic Studies & Feasibility Evaluation\r\nQHSE Metrics & Risk-Based Management\r\nEngineering Software (AutoCAD, Revit, Aspen HYSYS)\r\nTechnical Writing & Reports', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammad-al-salti-506828110/', '+905314313913', 'mgalsalti@gmail.com', '$2y$10$rTPfL1I.dZAWeu47ftfS8OLP5.OvGl0Iv28joSkjr8KoF8l8Prh2e', NULL, 3, 1, 1, 'cv_678d52d43708a.pdf', '', '', 'NAME: MOHAMMAD ALSALTI\r\nBANK NAME: Türkiye Finans\r\nBRANCH ADDRESS: Fatih Akdeniz Caddesi Branch\r\nIBAN: TR760020600342054326960102\r\nBANK ACCOUNT NUMBER: 5432696102\r\nSWIFT: AFKBTRIS', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-26 16:24:10', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'Advanced', 'Advanced'),
