(77, 'YAMEN SHABANKABAKIBOU', NULL, 3, 'Computer Engineering', 'I have a dissent background in management and technology consulting with a special focus on Advanced Data Analytics and big Data. I have been involved in the technical phases of project roadmap design, product & service development, and implementation. I am passionate about the opportunities resulting from the convergence of big data. I am comfortable with Google Cloud, and AWS, I worked extensively with the developers\' community, and enterprises, which helps in delivering value to my projects. My current focus is on architecting solutions based on cloud / on-prem native architecture.', 'Data Analysis, Data Engineering, Machine Learning, Database, Big Data, Data Lake, Data Lakehouse, Cloud, Databricks\r\nMicrosoft Tools (Azure, Power BI, SQL Server)', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/yamenshaban/', '+905050337798', 'yamenkaba@gmail.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 3, 1, 1, 'cv_678a719a78dee.pdf', 'img_678a719a80c27.jpg', '', 'NAME: YAMEN SHABANKABAKIBOU\r\nBANK NAME: KUVEYT TURK\r\nBRANCH ADDRESS: Kuveyt Türk Katılım Bankası - Sakarya Bosna Caddesi Şubesi\r\nIBAN: TR310020500009778553900101\r\nBank Account: 97785539\r\nSWIFT: KTEFTRISXXX', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-22 14:01:24', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None'),
