(84, 'MAAN CHIBLI', NULL, 1, 'Urban Planning and Environment', 'I am working as an Associate Professor at \"\"Bahçeşehir University\"\" in Istanbul. Previously, in the UAE, I worked at \"\"Abu Dhabi University\"\" besides running \"\"Al Madina Engineering Consultancy\"\" at Al Ain City (UAE).\r\n\r\nIn Aleppo, I worked as a consultant with \"\"GIZ\"\" between 1997-2003 for the \"\"Project for the Rehabilitation of Old Aleppo\"\", in addition, I provided consultancies for several International Organizations such as JICA, UNDP, EU, and ESCWA.\r\n\r\nI was the Mayor of Aleppo between 2003-2010.', 'Sustainable Development Strategies - Municipal Services Development – Strategic Planning – Urban Planning and Infrastructure - Integrated Urban Management Frameworks - Leadership and Strategic Impact - Architecture.\r\nAdministrative Planning & Monitoring	Leadership, Team Management & Supervision	Modern Management & Strategic Leadership			Time, Priority, & Stress Management					Improving Communication, Time & Organization, Technical Writing & Reports', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/maan-chibli-24b17317/', '+905316137404', 'mchibli75@gmail.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'cv_6788a8c3e15540.59104828.pdf', 'photo_6788a8c3e1f516.40754124.png', '', 'No details provided', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-25 14:06:16', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'Advanced', 'Advanced'),
(85, 'MUHAMMET HALIT ALKADRI', NULL, 2, 'Post-Disaster and Post-War Reconstruction and Rehabilitation', 'I am an architect with over five years of experience and a master\'s degree in Post-Disaster and Post-War Reconstruction and Rehabilitation, eager to join an esteemed organization. I emphasize a passion for sustainable buildings, precast building, industrial building, post-war recovery, and environmental design, and have a diverse background in project management, environmental analysis, parametric design, and psychology.\r\n\r\nI have published research in international journals and conferences, demonstrating a commitment to continuous learning and innovation.\r\nMy academic achievements include an MA in my specialized field, proficiency in engineering and architectural software, and practical experience through voluntary work and workshops. Additionally, my multilingual and culturally aware background enhances my receptiveness to diverse perspectives and innovative ideas.\r\n\r\nAs a content creator, I have produced documentaries on engineering and construction, highlighting their impact on ind', 'Architecture, sustainable buildings, precast building, industrial building, post-war recovery, and environmental design, project management, environmental analysis, parametric design, design, Autodesk, SketchUp, Lumion ,vary, Engineering Software, AutoCAD, Revit', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammet-halit-alkadri/', '+905525582459', 'mhamadkhaledalkadri@gmail.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 3, 1, 1, 'cv_67895b7b2838f1.29165379.pdf', 'photo_67895b7b288e43.19806383.jpg', '', 'No details provided', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-22 14:01:24', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None'),
(87, 'YASSER ALMASOOD', NULL, 3, 'Oil And Gas industry', '• Around 15 years in Refinery and GAS plant, SPC refinery and gas plant, ConocoPhillips Gas Plant , ADNOC gas & refinery ,worked in the field as DCS operator ,Shift controller ,Process engineer and OJT. \r\n• 7 years as oil and gas instructors, I deliver training for KNPC, KOC, KIPIC, ADNOC, NOC Libya, MellitahOG, BOC and others companies.', 'Oil and Gas Industry .Upstream. Downstream. Midstream Operations. process engineering\r\nOil Refining Process .Petroleum Engineering .Energy management. project management.Risk Assessment in Oil and Gas Hazardous Materials Handling Health, Safety, and Environment (HSE) Emergency Response Plans (ERP) Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) Oil and Gas Emissions Reduction Digital Twin Technology Industry 4.0 in Oil and Gas Oil and Gas Industry Standards OSHA Oil and Gas Safety Maintenance in Oilfields.\r\nENGINEERING & MAINTENANCE:\r\nAdvanced/General Maintenance (Electrical, Mechanical, Precision)\r\nOil & Gas Equipment Maintenance\r\nPMP & Project Management with AI\r\nEconomic Studies & Feasibility Evaluation\r\nQHSE Metrics & Risk-Based Management\r\nEngineering Software (AutoCAD, Revit, Aspen HYSYS)\r\nOIL & GAS INDUSTRY:\r\nDownstream/Midstream Regulations\r\nHEALTH, SAFETY & SECURITY:\r\nIndustrial Security & NEBOSH Certifications\r\nFirefighting Systems & Road Safety\r\n', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/yasser-almasood-95ba6797/', '+905395926746', 'yasseralmasood@yahoo.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'cv_678a28baaed958.94332552.pdf', 'photo_678a28baaf3510.72145121.jpg', '', 'NAME: YASSER ALMASOOD\nBANK NAME: Kuveyt Turk\nBRANCH ADDRESS: Kocasinan Merkez Mah. Mahmutbey Cad. No:172/A Istanbul/BAHCELIEVLER\nACCOUNT Number: 95908839-101\nIBAN: TR420020500009590883900101\nSWIFT: KTEFTRIS', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-10-03 07:01:02', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None');
