(91, 'Abdulkader Alwer', NULL, 1, 'Information Technology/Data Communication', 'I am Dr. Abdulkader Alwer, an accredited trainer and academic professor with 15+ years of experience designing and delivering specialized training programs in:\r\n Digital Transformation (Accounting, HR, Institutional Strategies).\r\n Artificial Intelligence (Optimizing KPIs, AI-Driven Strategies, Ethical Implications).\r\n Cybersecurity (Ethical Hacking, Digital Forensics, Risk Management).\r\n Data Analysis (Power BI, Advanced Excel).\r\n Networking & Infrastructure (Azure Certifications, Network+, ERP Systems).\r\n\r\nKey Highlights:\r\n\r\nDelivered 50+ courses (over 600+ training hours) to diverse audiences, including professionals, executives, and students, ensuring adaptability to all learning styles.\r\n\r\nBlend academic expertise (Assistant Professor in Communication Engineering) with practical applications to ensure interactive and impactful content.\r\n\r\nProfessionalism in Training Delivery:\r\n\r\nTailor content to audience needs, from technical specialists to non-technical stakeholders.\r\n\r\nFoster in', 'Cybersecurity , Cyber Security , Digital Transformation , Artificial Intelligence , AI , Data Analysis , Ethical Hacker , Digital Forensics for Incident Response , Power BI , Financial Data Analysis with Power BI , Network+ , Microsoft Azure , AI-Driven Business Strategy , ISO 27001 , CISM , electronic Archiving , Advanced Excel ( Pivot Table ) , ITIL , Information Technology Project Management, ISO 27032 , COBIT , MCSA Windows Server, CompTIA Pentation Test, CompTIA Security , Exchange Server, CCNA Routing & Switching , SharePoint administrator , Internet of Things (IoT) , Cloud Security , Data Governance & Privacy , Electronic Secretariat , Chat GPT for Business , Office 365 installation and management , Total Quality in Information Management , Modern applied systems for document and archive management and digital archiving of files , Data communication , IP communication , 5G, 6G\r\nADMINISTRATION & MANAGEMENT\r\nCOMMUNICATION & SOFT SKILLS\r\nENGINEERING & MAINTENANCE\r\nTECHNICAL TECHNOL', NULL, 'https://linkedin.com/in/engalwer', '+905379336360', 'eng_alwer2005@hotmail.com', '$2y$10$HrPxi0/NKlWPqOZhiCoVKeNSL1dBRaGU0RZOhUGp/NK76mtQga0sW', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '68a9bb0ddccf8.pdf', 'img_67ac60146e93d.jpg', '', 'NAME: ABDULKADER ALWER\r\nBANK NAME: Kuvyet Turk\r\nBRANCH ADDRESS: Taksim\r\nIBAN: TR130020500009814184300101\r\nBANK ACCOUNT NUMBER: 98141843\r\nSWIFT: KTEFTRISXXX', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-11-14 22:19:48', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'Advanced', 'Advanced'),
