(106, 'ALy yilmaz', NULL, 1, 'Accounting', 'Dr. Aly Yilmaz is a financial expert and management consultant who combines academic knowledge with over 30 years of practical experience. He holds a Ph.D. in Accounting from Al-Azhar University (2016) and a Master\'s degree in Cost Accounting from Suez Canal University (2004), along with various professional fellowships and specialized certifications.\r\n\r\nHe currently serves as a financial consultant at Mustafa Mohamed Ali Accounting Office in Doha - Qatar, an accredited arbitrator at the Qatar International Center for Conciliation and Arbitration, and a judge at the International Court of Dispute Resolution - London. He previously worked in several prestigious academic and professional institutions, including Umm Al-Qura University in Saudi Arabia and Mardin Artuklu University in Turkey.\r\n\r\nHe possesses extensive experience in financial and cost accounting, auditing, financial and management consulting, and commercial arbitration. He has provided consulting and training services to num', 'Training Areas and Programs:\r\n\r\nFinancial and Accounting Programs:\r\n1. International Accounting Standards (IAS/IFRS/IPSAS)\r\n2. Cost Accounting and Cost Reduction\r\n3. Financial Accounting and Financial Reporting\r\n4. Internal and External Auditing\r\n5. Cash Flow Management and Budgeting\r\n6. Zakat and Tax Accounting\r\n7. Basel Accords and Banking Risks\r\n8. Financial Technology (FinTech)\r\n9. Government and Public Sector Accounting\r\n\r\nManagement Development Programs:\r\n1. Strategic Planning and Strategy Development\r\n2. Monitoring, Control, and Performance Evaluation\r\n3. Professional Project Management\r\n4. Leadership and Team Management\r\n5. Time Management and Work Pressure\r\n6. Training of Trainers (TOT)\r\n7. Digital Transformation and Performance Improvement\r\n8. Administrative Report Preparation\r\n\r\nIslamic Economics Programs:\r\n1. Islamic Finance and Investment Tools\r\n2. Islamic Banking\r\n3. Islamic Insurance (Takaful)\r\n4. Islamic Financial Markets\r\n5. Zakat Accounting\r\n6. Sharia Standards for Fi', NULL, '', '+97430171556', 'aaayilmaz30@gmail.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 3, 9, 1, '', 'photo_67a9ed63bf8c84.43508902.JPG', '', 'No details provided', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-22 14:01:24', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None'),
