(109, 'Valeed Alsafadi', NULL, 2, 'Financial Risk Management', 'Waleed Alsafadi – Expert Trainer in Finance, Financial Planning, and management\r\nWith over 16 years of experience in financial management, accounting, and financial analysis, Waleed is a seasoned trainer dedicated to empowering professionals with practical knowledge and real-world applications. As the founder and CEO of Budget Consultancy and Development, Waleed has led numerous financial transformation projects, business valuations, and strategic consulting assignments across diverse industries, including banks, startups, NGOs, and SaaS companies.\r\nWaleed specializes in delivering training on financial management, financial modeling, budgeting, Financial Awareness, Using AI in Finance, Finance for no Finance people and Financial Planning and Analysis. His engaging training approach combines theoretical insights with hands-on case studies, ensuring participants gain actionable skills to apply in their careers and businesses.\r\nBeyond training, Waleed is an active contributor to financia', 'CMA, DCF, Financial Modeling, and Financial Analysis\r\nFinancial Planning and Analysis (FP&A)\r\nBudgeting and Forecasting\r\nFinancial Modeling Trainer\r\nBusiness Valuation Training\r\nStrategic Finance Training\r\nNGO Financial Management\r\nSaaS Finance\r\nFractional CFO Services\r\nFinance Consultant for Startups\r\nFinance and Accounting Training\r\nBanking Finance\r\nNGO Financial Planning\r\nADMINISTRATION & MANAGEMENT\r\nPROJECT MANAGEMENT & QUALITY\r\nTECHNICAL TECHNOLOGY SKILLS\r\n', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/waleedalsafadi/', '+905367119895', 'waleedalsafadi86@gmail.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'cv_67b1b34fe14005.15405940.pdf', 'photo_67b1b34fe26a84.24236596.png', '', 'No details provided', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-22 14:01:24', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None'),
