(126, 'ABDULLAH Saleh BEN AMER', NULL, 2, 'INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY/ INTERNET COMPUTING', 'An accomplished IT professional with a Master’s degree in Information Technology (Internet Computing) and a strong foundation in both networking and software development. Certified in CCNA, MCSE, and MCSA, with additional expertise in web design and programming (PHP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript), computer hardware, and database management. Brings years of hands-on experience in IT infrastructure, network administration, and full-stack development. \r\nDedicated to delivering high-quality training, bridging academic concepts with real-world applications, and empowering learners to achieve technical excellence.\r\n\r\nInterests:\r\nNetworking technologies and Cisco systems\r\nWeb application design and development\r\nDatabase design and optimization\r\nIT infrastructure and system administration\r\nEmerging trends in cloud computing and cybersecurity\r\nComputer hardware troubleshooting and assembly\r\nContinuous learning in new programming frameworks and tools\r\nSharing knowledge through hands-on', 'CCNA, Cisco Certified Network Associate, MCSE, Microsoft Certified Systems Engineer, MCSA, Microsoft Certified Solutions Associate, Web Design, Web Programming, PHP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Computer Hardware, Computer Maintenance, Database, MySQL, Network Administration, Infrastructure,  Support, Server Administration, Networking, Information Systems.', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/abdullah-s-ben-amer-a4a85315/', '+905349216965', 'abdullah.s.benamer@gmail.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'cv_683ae71f092826.99048499.pdf', 'photo_683ae71f09d295.69478934.jpg', '', 'ABDULLAH\r\nKUVEYTTURK\r\nOSMANBEY\r\nTR1234987653876542\r\n918634\r\nKTXXXXXXXX', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-09-05 03:25:39', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'Advanced', 'Advanced'),
