(132, 'NEZAR ELMAHALAWY', NULL, 1, 'MANAGEMENT', 'I have a strong interest and extensive work experience in the fields of management, business development, and institutional excellence. My expertise spans various areas, including preparing excellence awards portfolios and serving as a certified institutional excellence consultant in the United Arab Emirates. I also possess significant experience as an international trainer in countries such as the UAE, Bahrain, Turkey, Oman, and Egypt, with over 21 years in this role.\r\nFurthermore, I am highly interested and experienced in digital marketing and technology business solutions. This includes expertise in digital media marketing, SEO, social media, content management, branding, and media management. I\'ve also served as an international judge for prestigious awards like the Stevie International Business Awards and the Canadian Marketing Association (CMA) Award. My academic background supports my professional interests, with a Doctoral Degree in Business Administration from Cairo University', 'Management \r\nBusiness Development\r\nInstitutional Excellence\r\nDigital Marketing\r\nConsulting\r\nTraining \r\nQuality Management (including ISO, Six Sigma)\r\nAwards Assessment/Judging\r\nHuman Resources (specifically HR Awards/Management) \r\nLeadership Coaching (Life Coach, Business Life Coach)\r\nSales Team Training, ADMINISTRATION & MANAGEMENT\r\nCOMMUNICATION & SOFT SKILLS', NULL, 'https://www.facebook.com/nezar.ibn.kamal/', '+905519963777', 'dr_nezar_k@yahoo.com', '$2y$10$QuzMO0xXYEmWXHKT.zQ/oeyzMYQbv75DUqOAjkwkKDBOiYHhc0vje', NULL, 4, 1, 1, '68adb45f71a35.pdf', '68adb45f72111.jpg', '', 'No details provided', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-11-14 22:19:58', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None'),
(133, 'Sohaib Al Salamat', NULL, 3, 'WEB PROGRAMMING', 'Experienced Full-stack Developer proficient in JavaScript, with expertise in\r\nframeworks like Vue.js and React.js. Skilled in Python frameworks such as Django\r\nand Flask, with a successful track record of delivering scalable applications. Founder\r\nof the Jack-ai platform, utilizing advanced Generative AI techniques to create\r\ncustom AI assistants and robots. Passionate about training and mentoring, with\r\ndemonstrated experience in delivering technical training sessions and fostering skill\r\ndevelopment among aspiring developers. Committed to leveraging cutting-edge\r\ntools like Generative AI, LLMs, and emerging technologies while sharing knowledge\r\nthrough training and interactive programs.', 'Front-end:\r\nJavaScript , TypeScript , Vue 2,3 ,\r\nNuxt Js 2,3 , React , Next Js ,\r\nThree Js , Redux , Pinia , Zustand ,\r\nVite , Webpack , PWA , SSR , SEO\r\nVuetify , MUI , Tailwind , Bootstrap\r\nBack-end:\r\nPython , Django , Flask , Redis\r\nDatabase: MYSQL , PostgreSQL , MongoDB\r\nDeployment:\r\nLinux , Docker , CI/CD , AWS\r\nWeb servers (Nginx, Apache)\r\nDomain and DNS management\r\nDeployment automation\r\nGit , Restful API , PyQt5 , Web.3', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/sohep-alslamat/', '+905310800334', 'sohaib.alslamat@gmail.com', '$2y$10$qFAI3tWJZAUPyf0UgeTPWuIYM71wkwFmQVvG2l.mZRtIPTRN6C4pq', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'cv_689084db813388.70044215.pdf', 'photo_689084db821924.31412189.PNG', '', 'No details provided', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-22 14:01:24', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None'),
(134, 'ABDULRAHMAN SHALATI', NULL, 3, 'INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY', 'As an Information Technology Specialist at Madar Group, I work with a team of IT professionals to provide reliable, secure, and efficient IT solutions for the company\'s headquarters and branches. I am responsible for managing IT procurement, operating systems, technical support, and network infrastructure, as well as implementing information security policies and best practices. I am also pursuing the (ISC)² certification to enhance my skills and knowledge in cyber security.\r\n\r\nWith over 22 years of experience in the IT industry, I have developed a strong background in IT service management, virtualization, servers, active directory, windows server, WiFi technologies, and data center. I have successfully led and supported multiple IT projects, such as upgrading the network infrastructure at Naif Arab University for Security sciences, where I was the IT Manager for 3 years, and establishing the network and operation department at Naif Arab University for Security Sciences, where I was t', 'Information Security \r\nCyber Security\r\nNetworking & Communications\r\nIT', NULL, '', '+905050895585', 'abdulrahman.shalati@gmail.com', '$2y$10$N3FKSSvZ5B4VbggM0sjqk.MaIuAEXfbZIuehXKRo0HWY4o/mGjGLS', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'cv_6891e6fe857da4.45383305.pdf', '', '', 'No details provided', '2025-08-07 12:45:59', '2025-08-25 01:31:45', 1, 'male', 0, 'pending', 'None', 'None'),
