(140, 'Nedim Sarraç', NULL, 3, 'Banking and finance', 'Highly accomplished and results-oriented professional with over 16 years of progressive experience in Business Training, Customer Service Management, and Leadership. Proven expertise in designing and delivering impactful training programs across a range of soft skills and business topics, significantly enhancing participant capabilities and receiving positive feedback. Skilled in managing and optimizing customer service operations to ensure top-notch service quality, drive customer satisfaction, and build loyalty. Experienced in building and leading high-performing teams, providing coaching and mentorship to foster individual and collective success. Adept at analysis, problem-solving, and implementing strategies to achieve organizational goals. Passionate about continuous learning and empowering others to excel. Seeking to leverage extensive training and customer service leadership experience in a dynamic environment.\r\nADMINISTRATION & MANAGEMENT\r\nCOMMUNICATION & SOFT SKILLS\r\nPROJECT M', '● Accounting ● Accurate ● Adaptability ● Administration ● Analysis ● Direct Sales ● Employee Relations ● Employee Training ● Financial Analysis ● Forecasting ● Business Development ● HR Policies ● Coaching ● Communication ● Communication Skills ● Customer Experience ● Customer Retention ● Information Technology ● Internal Audit ● Interviews ● Job Descriptions ● Microsoft Office ● Microsoft Word ● Mobile Devices ● Negotiation ● Networking ● Organised ● Payroll ● Risk Management ● Sales ● Seek new challenges ● Stress Management ● Supervisory Skills ● System Administration ● Team Building ● PC maintenance & assembling ● Team Leadership ● Performance Management ● Policy ● Key Performance Indicators ● PowerPoint ● Customer Satisfaction ● Knowledge Sharing ● Customer Service ● Leadership ● Problem Solving ● Report Writing ● Team Management ● Teamwork ● Time Management ● Training', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/nadimsarraj/