(36, 1, 107, 'Geology and Geophysics programs', '2024-09-29', 'Ahmed Arebi، Zuetina\r\n+218 92-5222616\r\n\r\n If it is possible the programs should handle the following practical issues:\r\n - Quantitative Seismic Interpretation (attribute inversion, AVO)\r\n - Advanced Seismic Interpretation & Seismic sequence stratigraphic\r\n - Seismic Depth conversion & Seismic velocity modelling\r\n - Seismic Acquisition & Processing\r\n - !!! Wellsite Geology & Operations\r\n - Static Geological Modelling & Reservoir Characterizations\r\n - !!! Advanced Well Log Interpretation & petrophysical analysis & LWD Interpretation\r\n - !!! Formation Evaluation & Correlations with Core Analysis Data\r\n- ENHANCED OIL RECOVERY\r\n- WELL-TEST-ANALYSIS\r\n- APPLIED RESERVOIR ENGINEERING & MANAGEMENT', '', 6, 'completed'),
