(79, 1, 139, 'QHSE KPO’s and BSC  - Transportation .......', '2024-11-15', '1.	Course Tittle : QHSE KPO’s and Balanced Scorecard  \r\n            Duration : 2 Weeks \r\n            Location : Turkey \r\n\r\n\r\n2.	Course Tittle : Transportation of Dangerous Goods . \r\n      Duration : 2 Weeks \r\n            Location : Turkey \r\n\r\nWe are looking forward for your feedback .\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\n\r\nBest regards.\r\n \r\nMabruk Oil Operations (Formerly known as COMPAGNIE DES PETROLES TOTAL LIBYE – (C.P.T.L)\r\n \r\nAisha Serkik\r\nTraining & Development Section \r\nHR Department\r\nDhat El Imad Complex: Tower 4 , Floor 16\r\nP.O.BOX 91171, Tripoli - Libya\r\nTel.:   +218 21 33 50 401 Ext 1604or TEAMS Microsoft \r\nEmail: aisha.serkik@mabruk-oil.com \r\n \r\n\r\n', '', 8, 'under-process'),
